   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": {
      "zh": "{{t:mantodea}}的 mantis 在希腊文里是「先知」，大概因为螳螂举起前足，好像在祈祷。",
      "en": "The 'mantis' in {{t:mantodea}} is Greek for 'prophet', perhaps because a mantis holds up its front legs as if praying.",
      "ms": "'Mantis' dalam {{t:mantodea}} bermaksud 'nabi' dalam bahasa Yunani, mungkin kerana cengkadak mengangkat kaki depannya seolah-olah berdoa."
     },
     "defines": [
      "mantodea"
     ],
     "src": [
      "LSJ"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "ids": [
      "orchid-mantis-hymenopus",
      "mantis-camelomantis"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "kind": "key",
     "text": {
      "zh": "「祈祷」：举起带刺的前足，等猎物上门。",
      "en": "Think 'praying': spiny front legs raised, waiting for prey.",
      "ms": "Ingat 'berdoa': kaki depan berduri diangkat, menunggu mangsa."
     },
     "src": [
      "LSJ"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      {
       "zh": "前足是有刺的捕捉足，可以夹住猎物",
       "en": "Spiny grasping front legs that seize prey",
       "ms": "Kaki depan penangkap berduri yang menangkap mangsa"
      },
      {
       "zh": "前翅像皮革（覆翅）",
       "en": "Leathery forewings (tegmina)",
       "ms": "Sayap depan seperti kulit (tegmina)"
      },
      {
       "zh": "捕食其他昆虫",
       "en": "Hunts other insects",
       "ms": "Memburu serangga lain"
      }
     ],
     "src": [
